[{"answer":"So, Tim, we have to do a short summary of our work experience on a farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. My farm was great,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/2.mp3"},{"answer":"but arranging the work experience was hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/3.mp3"},{"answer":"One problem was it was miles away and I don't drive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/4.mp3"},{"answer":"And also, I'd really wanted a placement for a month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/5.mp3"},{"answer":"but I could only get one for two weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I was lucky,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/7.mp3"},{"answer":"the farmer let me stay on the farm so I didn't have to travel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/8.mp3"},{"answer":"But finding the right sort of farm to apply to wasn't easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/9.mp3"},{"answer":"No, they don't seem to have websites, do they.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I found mine through a friend of my mother's, but it wasn't easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/11.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/12.mp3"},{"answer":"My farm was mostly livestock, especially sheep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I really enjoyed helping out with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I was up most of one night helping a sheep deliver a lamb...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/15.mp3"},{"answer":"On your own?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/16.mp3"},{"answer":"No, the farmer was there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and he told me what to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It wasn't a straightforward birth, but I managed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a great feeling to see the lamb stagger to its feet and start feeding almost straightaway,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and to know that it was OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Then another time a lamb had broken its leg,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and they got the vet in to set it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and he talked me through what he was doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That was really useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, my farm had sheep too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The farm was in a valley and they had a lowland breed called Suffolks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/27.mp3"},{"answer":"although the farmer said they'd had other breeds in the past.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So were they bred for their meat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Mostly, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/30.mp3"},{"answer":"They're quite big and solid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/31.mp3"},{"answer":"My farm was up in the hills and they had a different breed of sheep,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/32.mp3"},{"answer":"they were Cheviots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I heard their wool's really sought after.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It's very hardwearing and they use it for carpets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/36-2023-01-05-23-12-42.mp3"},{"answer":"I was interested in the amount of supplements they add to animals' feed nowadays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, even the chickens got extra vitamins and electrolytes in their feed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I found that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And they're not cheap.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/40.mp3"},{"answer":"But my farmer said some are overpriced for what they are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And he didn't give them as a matter of routine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/42.mp3"},{"answer":"just at times when the chickens seemed to particularly require them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, mine said the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/44.mp3"},{"answer":"He said certain breeds of chickens might need more supplements than the others,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/45.mp3"},{"answer":"but the cheap and expensive ones are all basically the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/46.mp3"},{"answer":"So did your farm have any other livestock, Diana?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, dairy cows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I made a really embarrassing mistake when I was working in the milk shed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Some cows had been treated with antibiotics,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/50.mp3"},{"answer":"so their milk wasn't suitable for human consumption,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and it had to be put in a separate container.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/52.mp3"},{"answer":"But I got mixed up,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and I poured some milk from the wrong cow in with the milk for humans,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/54.mp3"},{"answer":"so the whole lot had to be thrown away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The farmer wasn't too happy with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I asked my farmer how much he depended on the vet to deal with health problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd read reports that the livestock's health is being affected","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/58.mp3"},{"answer":"as farmers are under pressure to increase production.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, he didn't agree with that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but he said that actually some of the stuff the vets do, like minor operations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/61.mp3"},{"answer":"he'd be quite capable of doing himself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. My farmer said the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/63.mp3"},{"answer":"But he reckons vets' skills are still needed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Now we've got to give a bit of feedback about last term's modules,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/65.mp3"},{"answer":"just short comments, apparently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we do that now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/67.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/68.mp3"},{"answer":"So medical terminology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my heart sank when I saw that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/70.mp3"},{"answer":"especially right at the beginning of the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And I did struggle with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it'd be hard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/73.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually I found it all quite straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/74.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you think about diet and nutrition?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/75.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you remember what they told us about pet food","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/77.mp3"},{"answer":"and the fact that there's such limited checking into whether or not it's contaminated?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean in comparison with the checks on food for humans,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/79.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that was terrible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the module that really impressed me was the animal disease one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/81.mp3"},{"answer":"when we looked at domesticated animals in different parts of the world,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/82.mp3"},{"answer":"like camels and water buffalo and alpaca.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/83.mp3"},{"answer":"The economies of so many countries depend on these,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/84.mp3"},{"answer":"but scientists don't know much about the diseases that affect them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/86.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought they'd know a lot about ways of controlling and eradicating those diseases,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/87.mp3"},{"answer":"but that's not the case at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/88-2023-01-05-23-31-42.mp3"},{"answer":"I loved the wildlife medication unit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like helping birds that have been caught in oil spills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/90.mp3"},{"answer":"That's something I hadn't thought about before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I thought I might write my dissertation on something connected with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/92.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. So, actually I was thinking...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-3-2022-12-19-21-31-08/93.mp3"}]
